WEBVTT

00:12.012 --> 00:14.097
I can have the jet ready in four days.

00:17.976 --> 00:18.935
To where?

00:19.436 --> 00:23.064
I'm thinking Thailand or Vietnam,
but wouldn't you prefer Thailand?

00:23.148 --> 00:25.066
You know people there.

00:25.150 --> 00:25.984
So?

00:27.652 --> 00:29.320
I'll proceed with Thailand.

00:30.321 --> 00:33.742
Regarding the kidnapping
of Kim Gun-woo's mother,

00:33.825 --> 00:36.536
I recommend S-class bloodhounds.

00:36.619 --> 00:40.749
Three should get the job done.

00:41.833 --> 00:42.834
How much?

00:43.418 --> 00:45.795
I need 900 million won,
300 million per head.

00:47.964 --> 00:50.091
A warrant is out,
and we don't have much time.

00:50.175 --> 00:52.052
We should get this done right.

00:52.135 --> 00:53.762
This investment is

00:54.929 --> 00:55.847
necessary.

00:56.556 --> 00:58.141
S-class is different.

00:58.892 --> 01:01.311
I'll stake my life on it.

01:02.479 --> 01:05.482
They will succeed without fail.

01:08.359 --> 01:11.154
Pick two, and lead them yourself.

01:14.908 --> 01:15.909
Understood.

01:18.745 --> 01:19.579
Who is it?

01:20.747 --> 01:21.790
It's my mother.

01:22.540 --> 01:23.374
Pick it up.

01:26.628 --> 01:28.505
-Hello.
-Where are you?

01:28.588 --> 01:30.757
-Why?
-Min-a got hit by a car.

01:30.840 --> 01:32.842
What? How bad is it?

01:33.468 --> 01:35.053
-Where are you?
-In the ER.

01:35.136 --> 01:37.764
We're at Seonkuk Medical
near the house. Hurry.

01:37.847 --> 01:38.807
On my way.

01:42.769 --> 01:45.396
My daughter is hurt.
She's at the hospital.

01:53.279 --> 01:54.280
Go.

02:25.395 --> 02:26.855
Show me your ID, please.

02:29.607 --> 02:30.441
One second.

02:31.276 --> 02:32.485
Patient's name?

02:32.569 --> 02:33.570
It's Yun Min-a.

02:33.653 --> 02:36.614
You're good to go. Inside, to the left.

02:45.290 --> 02:46.124
Min-a.

02:47.125 --> 02:48.084
Dad!

02:49.127 --> 02:50.003
Positions. Now!

02:55.884 --> 02:56.718
Are you okay?

02:57.385 --> 02:58.219
What?

03:00.972 --> 03:02.557
Enough is enough.

03:03.057 --> 03:05.393
Please stop all of this!

03:08.396 --> 03:09.814
Tae-geom!

03:11.566 --> 03:12.734
Stop! Stay back!

03:14.152 --> 03:15.195
Stand down!

03:15.695 --> 03:17.280
Put the guns down.

03:17.363 --> 03:18.281
Min-a.

03:18.948 --> 03:20.700
Close your eyes. Hold on tight.

03:21.451 --> 03:22.285
Guns down.

03:28.917 --> 03:31.252
Hey, put them down. It's okay.

03:32.795 --> 03:33.630
Easy.

03:38.760 --> 03:39.969
Tae-geom.

03:40.678 --> 03:41.888
Let's not do this.

03:44.557 --> 03:45.516
You and I…

03:46.559 --> 03:47.393
We can talk.

03:47.477 --> 03:49.646
I'm really here to talk today.

03:55.902 --> 03:58.947
I have a daughter just about Min-a's age.

04:01.741 --> 04:03.076
Dad to dad,

04:04.035 --> 04:05.495
let us talk.

04:23.304 --> 04:24.639
How may I help you?

04:29.978 --> 04:32.480
You have a visitor sent by your uncle.

04:42.490 --> 04:44.701
Thank you for making the trip.

04:52.583 --> 04:54.377
Hello. I'm Pre Mi-um.

04:58.089 --> 04:59.590
It's an unusual name, right?

05:00.925 --> 05:02.427
It's my code name.

05:33.291 --> 05:35.835
BLOODHOUNDS 2

05:39.756 --> 05:43.384
If you get caught now,
it's life in prison or the death penalty.

05:43.468 --> 05:46.929
If you help us,
I'll push for a life sentence.

05:47.847 --> 05:49.474
What would that change?

05:49.557 --> 05:51.601
A death sentence

05:51.684 --> 05:53.686
means no parole and no visitors.

05:53.770 --> 05:58.566
But with a life sentence,
you can apply for parole on good behavior.

06:05.907 --> 06:07.241
Mr. Yun.

06:08.701 --> 06:10.036
No, Tae-geom.

06:10.536 --> 06:15.375
You started working for Im Baek-jeong
to provide for your family, didn't you?

06:16.376 --> 06:19.462
Then you should do
whatever it takes to survive

06:19.545 --> 06:21.881
so you can protect them.

06:21.964 --> 06:23.091
Your family?

06:23.591 --> 06:26.803
They'll never quit on you,
no matter how much you screw up.

06:26.886 --> 06:28.096
And your mother?

06:28.596 --> 06:32.600
She'd do anything for her son,
even if it means laying down her own life.

06:32.683 --> 06:35.395
What about your daughter? You little…

06:35.478 --> 06:39.899
Your daughter would spend her whole life
waiting to see her dad.

06:40.400 --> 06:43.611
"What would that change?"

06:44.112 --> 06:46.197
You'd give up just like that?

06:46.280 --> 06:49.700
You call that being a father?

06:50.868 --> 06:53.454
Go ahead. Like that will change anything.

06:57.083 --> 06:57.917
Tae-geom.

06:59.252 --> 07:01.504
It's not over until it's over.

07:02.296 --> 07:05.466
There are still things
we can do for each other.

07:07.802 --> 07:09.262
Work with us.

07:18.813 --> 07:21.232
Protect my family from Im Baek-jeong.

07:24.152 --> 07:25.445
I give you my word.

07:29.907 --> 07:31.033
What should I do?

07:32.243 --> 07:35.371
First of all, where is Im Baek-jeong?

07:35.455 --> 07:38.249
He's on a yacht on the Hangang River,
always moving.

07:38.749 --> 07:40.626
He'll tell me the pickup location.

07:40.710 --> 07:43.087
There are three docking points.

07:45.131 --> 07:46.215
Smart.

07:49.135 --> 07:50.511
Should we raid them tonight?

07:50.595 --> 07:54.974
If we fail,
won't that put Tae-geom in danger?

07:55.558 --> 07:58.227
How about we protect Tae-geom
and bide our time?

07:59.228 --> 08:01.606
Yes, you're right.

08:03.149 --> 08:06.861
By the way, how did he know
we were raiding the Entra Hotel?

08:06.944 --> 08:09.280
As far as I know,
a hotel employee informed him.

08:11.032 --> 08:12.575
So he paid people off?

08:12.658 --> 08:13.534
Yes.

08:14.035 --> 08:16.746
Who's running the show for him?
That's what I want to know.

08:16.829 --> 08:19.290
Is he a cop?

08:19.874 --> 08:22.502
His name is Lee Dong-hyeon,
a former NIS agent.

08:25.546 --> 08:26.797
Is that Lee Man-bae?

08:27.381 --> 08:28.966
Lee Dong-hyeon is his real name.

08:29.050 --> 08:31.844
He ordered the hit on Gi-na, didn't he?

08:31.928 --> 08:32.887
Yes.

08:33.387 --> 08:35.097
Who's the cop he paid off?

08:35.181 --> 08:36.641
I don't know.

08:37.642 --> 08:41.687
Based on what I overheard,
I'm sure there were quite a few.

08:42.313 --> 08:43.773
He's a meticulous man.

08:43.856 --> 08:46.901
Then he must know
about the warrant for Im Baek-jeong.

08:48.152 --> 08:50.238
Dong-hyeon's looking for a private jet.

08:50.738 --> 08:52.323
He's fleeing to Thailand.

08:54.242 --> 08:56.160
That's impossible. We have a warrant.

08:56.244 --> 08:58.621
Lee Dong-hyeon will make it happen.

08:59.247 --> 09:00.081
God.

09:01.332 --> 09:02.708
Our goal is

09:04.001 --> 09:06.963
to kidnap Gun-woo's mother
and take her to Thailand.

09:07.046 --> 09:09.465
President Im wants to fight Gun-woo again.

09:09.549 --> 09:12.385
So he's kidnapping his mother
to lure him in.

09:12.468 --> 09:13.719
For money?

09:14.845 --> 09:17.848
This time, I believe
he has a more personal reason.

09:18.683 --> 09:22.144
He thinks he lost to Gun-woo
in the last fight.

09:23.729 --> 09:28.109
Because viewers all over the world
were rooting for Gun-woo.

09:28.609 --> 09:30.570
So while everyone's watching,

09:32.196 --> 09:33.739
he'll kill Gun-woo.

09:35.950 --> 09:36.993
Kill him?

09:39.203 --> 09:41.914
There are a few ways to fight in the IKFC.

09:41.998 --> 09:44.041
One of them is a death match.

09:44.625 --> 09:46.586
It's a fight to the death.

09:47.253 --> 09:48.963
It's the ultimate money fight.

09:49.463 --> 09:52.425
What's their plan
for kidnapping Gun-woo's mother?

09:52.508 --> 09:54.677
Dong-hyeon is recruiting
S-class bloodhounds.

09:54.760 --> 09:56.053
What's that?

09:56.846 --> 09:58.639
They are contract killers.

09:59.140 --> 10:01.684
The ones Dong-hyeon calls S-class

10:02.351 --> 10:03.936
are extremely lethal.

10:04.520 --> 10:08.107
Does he also know
where Gun-woo's mother is staying?

10:09.567 --> 10:10.568
I don't know.

10:10.651 --> 10:12.194
Was it ever mentioned?

10:14.155 --> 10:15.072
No.

10:19.035 --> 10:20.494
PRESIDENT

10:21.370 --> 10:22.204
Im Baek-jeong?

10:24.415 --> 10:28.294
Tell him Min-a injured her head,
and she's waiting for a CT scan.

10:33.716 --> 10:34.800
-Hello?
-How is she?

10:36.135 --> 10:39.639
She hit her head on the pavement,
so she's waiting for a CT scan.

10:45.478 --> 10:46.812
Finish up and get back.

10:47.521 --> 10:48.356
Yes, sir.

10:51.484 --> 10:52.443
Tae-geom.

11:04.497 --> 11:06.707
-Mr. Kim Jin-su, please come in.
-Okay.

11:10.336 --> 11:13.506
The wound is healing well,
so there is no need to worry.

11:13.589 --> 11:14.674
Thank you.

11:20.096 --> 11:21.263
How's your shoulder?

11:21.847 --> 11:23.891
I'm feeling a dull throb.

11:24.392 --> 11:25.476
Let me take a look.

11:32.149 --> 11:33.442
Do you need more meds?

11:34.944 --> 11:36.112
I'm okay.

11:36.612 --> 11:37.571
Okay.

11:51.752 --> 11:52.670
Min-beom.

11:55.923 --> 11:56.966
Are you okay?

11:58.592 --> 12:00.136
This room's a bit cramped.

12:00.886 --> 12:02.179
Can I get you a bigger one?

12:02.930 --> 12:06.100
This is more than enough. Thank you.

12:06.684 --> 12:08.561
I'm on my way to see Gang-yong.

12:08.644 --> 12:09.979
I'll come with you.

12:10.062 --> 12:11.522
No, you should rest.

12:12.648 --> 12:14.275
I'll call you after.

12:16.610 --> 12:17.528
See you later.

12:18.696 --> 12:19.572
Okay.

12:38.924 --> 12:40.968
Seul-gi, do you have a code name?

12:41.552 --> 12:42.887
No, sir. Not yet.

12:43.929 --> 12:45.973
Since you have soft features,

12:46.557 --> 12:48.559
you need a strong name

12:49.268 --> 12:50.227
like

12:51.353 --> 12:52.313
Wea Pon-ry?

12:54.315 --> 12:55.149
Wea Pon-ry?

12:59.862 --> 13:00.696
No?

13:01.280 --> 13:02.281
It's an honor.

13:05.409 --> 13:06.285
I was kidding.

13:06.952 --> 13:08.537
What kind of name is that?

13:12.041 --> 13:13.209
How about Po Wer-ful?

13:16.086 --> 13:17.004
Wer-ful?

13:19.006 --> 13:19.840
Yeah.

13:23.761 --> 13:24.762
It's an honor.

13:26.388 --> 13:28.015
I'm good at making code names.

13:36.106 --> 13:36.941
Hello?

13:37.525 --> 13:38.567
Meeting starting.

13:38.651 --> 13:39.610
Okay.

13:42.696 --> 13:45.241
HONG MIN-BEOM
PRESIDENT OF IIL GROUP

13:45.324 --> 13:46.283
We get two shots.

13:46.951 --> 13:49.245
When they move in
to grab Gun-woo's mother,

13:49.328 --> 13:51.664
and when they step off the boat to bolt.

13:52.915 --> 13:54.959
Can we trust that man?

13:55.543 --> 13:56.502
Yun Tae-geom?

13:57.336 --> 13:58.671
You can trust him.

13:58.754 --> 14:00.714
I agree.

14:01.423 --> 14:04.093
What about Gun-woo's mother? Is she safe?

14:04.176 --> 14:06.220
We've talked about that too.

14:06.303 --> 14:07.888
She's safest where she is now.

14:07.972 --> 14:08.973
There are guards,

14:09.056 --> 14:11.934
and Woo-jin and Woo-jeong
will be at the hotel to keep her safe.

14:12.810 --> 14:14.728
Does Gun-woo know

14:15.938 --> 14:17.106
she's the target?

14:17.690 --> 14:18.691
I didn't tell him.

14:18.774 --> 14:20.985
He'd bolt from the hospital
in a heartbeat.

14:21.569 --> 14:22.862
He would.

14:24.572 --> 14:28.158
Gun-woo should focus on his recovery.

14:28.868 --> 14:30.578
We can keep his mother safe.

14:31.912 --> 14:34.874
It's more dangerous if Gun-woo fights now.

14:38.127 --> 14:39.211
What will you do…

14:41.255 --> 14:42.673
when you catch them?

14:43.966 --> 14:44.800
What?

14:50.723 --> 14:52.349
I'll make them face the law.

14:54.310 --> 14:56.186
For me, that's not good enough.

14:57.479 --> 15:00.649
Even with Kim Myeong-gil behind bars,
I'm still terrified.

15:02.651 --> 15:04.320
What do you want to do?

15:06.322 --> 15:07.573
Could you excuse us?

15:08.324 --> 15:09.909
No, Gwang-mu. It's okay.

15:11.577 --> 15:12.953
It's fine. Tell us.

15:21.337 --> 15:22.296
I want them dead.

15:25.174 --> 15:26.800
Uncle

15:27.509 --> 15:29.011
assigned someone to me.

15:31.555 --> 15:32.640
Who?

15:33.891 --> 15:34.850
A black ops agent.

15:37.686 --> 15:40.856
This is our problem.
The NIS shouldn't get involved.

15:40.940 --> 15:43.567
-Can you kill those bastards?
-Min-beom.

15:44.276 --> 15:47.363
Our job is to make them face the law,

15:47.446 --> 15:49.698
return their illegal assets to society,

15:49.782 --> 15:52.034
and lock them up
so they pay for their crimes.

15:52.117 --> 15:54.161
That's justice.

15:58.540 --> 16:01.126
I want those bastards in the ground.

16:02.461 --> 16:03.629
That's not our job.

16:03.712 --> 16:05.047
That's why I got someone.

16:05.547 --> 16:08.509
Min-beom, we can't go rogue like this.

16:14.473 --> 16:16.016
I'll handle it my way.

16:29.655 --> 16:32.616
You know my dad took bronze
at the Barcelona Olympics, right?

16:33.742 --> 16:38.080
So I just thought I'd ask him
if he knew Im Baek-jeong.

16:39.456 --> 16:41.917
His buddy from the gym
trained Im Baek-jeong.

16:42.543 --> 16:43.627
Oh my God.

16:45.045 --> 16:49.258
Im Baek-jeong was a switch-hitter
with a hell of a punch, so he remembered.

16:49.341 --> 16:53.929
My father says everyone expected him
to become a world champion,

16:54.430 --> 16:56.849
but he was ruined
because he was a total scumbag.

16:59.018 --> 17:03.772
So I asked him if he was still in touch
with Im Baek-jeong's coach.

17:05.190 --> 17:09.028
A coach knows his fighters inside out.

17:09.111 --> 17:11.447
Their go-to moves, habits, and weaknesses.

17:11.530 --> 17:14.658
Right, just like how you know
everything about me.

17:16.201 --> 17:21.540
I've been watching the clip
of your fight with Im Baek-jeong on loop.

17:22.249 --> 17:27.463
I kept thinking about what advice
I should give you to beat Im Baek-jeong.

17:30.007 --> 17:33.385
As a coach, I'm just not good enough.
I can't find the answer.

17:34.011 --> 17:37.473
This isn't on you.
I've never seen a switch-hitter like that.

17:37.556 --> 17:40.142
He kept switching his stance.
I couldn't keep up.

17:41.393 --> 17:43.479
His left jab had a real sting.

17:43.562 --> 17:46.231
It was heavy,
and his right hand was real fast.

17:47.316 --> 17:50.319
Honestly, I don't remember how I fought.

17:53.864 --> 17:54.698
So, Gun-woo,

17:55.491 --> 17:58.744
why don't we train

17:58.827 --> 18:00.704
with Im Baek-jeong's coach?

18:01.455 --> 18:06.085
He might know
just how to beat Im Baek-jeong.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.838
-Okay.
-Right?

18:10.672 --> 18:11.548
I want to win.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.722
-Are you okay?
-What are you doing?

18:19.306 --> 18:20.349
Huh?

18:20.933 --> 18:22.851
-Come eat.
-Okay.

18:35.948 --> 18:37.950
-Take your time.
-Okay.

18:38.450 --> 18:39.284
Here.

18:42.246 --> 18:45.833
I don't want you doing anything dangerous.

18:49.795 --> 18:52.214
It breaks my heart to see you get hurt.

18:55.092 --> 18:56.552
Don't worry, Mom.

18:56.635 --> 18:59.221
How can I not worry
when you're beaten up like this?

19:03.267 --> 19:05.018
I'll take better care of him.

19:07.729 --> 19:08.605
Go on. Eat.

19:11.275 --> 19:12.109
No kimchi?

19:12.943 --> 19:14.153
Just eat your food.

19:15.112 --> 19:15.988
Okay.

19:16.572 --> 19:19.533
After this, we can go eat
kimchi cup noodles.

19:19.616 --> 19:21.410
-It's basically the same.
-Cool.

19:23.954 --> 19:25.747
The omelets are better cold.

19:26.915 --> 19:30.627
I used the whole carton. Enjoy.

19:31.128 --> 19:32.838
-Okay.
-Here.

19:34.131 --> 19:37.467
We're running two teams,
each on a 12-hour shift.

19:38.051 --> 19:42.264
Both Team A and Team B will be staying
on the 16th floor of the hotel.

19:42.347 --> 19:45.350
Both teams will respond
in case of an emergency.

19:46.518 --> 19:48.896
How many people are we talking about here?

19:48.979 --> 19:50.772
Ten, plus me and the deputy.

19:50.856 --> 19:53.025
They must be pros, right?

19:53.108 --> 19:54.401
Yes, they are.

19:58.197 --> 20:01.783
By the way,
when we take down Im Baek-jeong,

20:02.367 --> 20:05.120
do we have enough people in our division?

20:09.041 --> 20:12.878
-We need more.
-Should I request the mobile police unit?

20:13.754 --> 20:16.715
That's not what I meant.

20:17.633 --> 20:21.553
I'm worried because we don't know
who took Im Baek-jeong's money.

20:23.597 --> 20:24.431
God.

20:24.932 --> 20:28.143
Mr. Min, should I call in
some of my Marine buddies?

20:30.187 --> 20:32.356
That's a bit…

20:32.439 --> 20:33.690
I see.

20:35.025 --> 20:36.735
How about the Green Pine Tree Club?

20:43.075 --> 20:44.660
Sergeant Yoon Han-gu?

20:47.412 --> 20:49.915
Is Han-gu in Suwon now?

20:49.998 --> 20:51.041
Yes.

20:51.541 --> 20:55.045
Im Baek-jeong's money
probably hasn't reached that far.

20:56.255 --> 20:57.965
Okay, I'll give him a call.

21:47.889 --> 21:49.808
Yes, okay.

21:52.394 --> 21:53.395
Understood.

22:00.027 --> 22:01.987
We pull the stitches at ten tomorrow.

22:02.070 --> 22:03.030
Yes, sir.

22:03.113 --> 22:05.782
We move Gun-woo's mom
the night after next.

22:06.908 --> 22:10.120
Say bye to your daughter.
This time, it'll be a while.

22:15.625 --> 22:16.501
Yes, sir.

22:33.435 --> 22:34.394
Thank you, Han-gu.

22:34.978 --> 22:35.937
Of course.

22:36.438 --> 22:38.315
-These are my colleagues.
-Hello.

22:38.398 --> 22:39.524
This is our captain.

22:39.608 --> 22:41.401
-Thanks for coming.
-Nice to meet you.

22:44.196 --> 22:46.782
The owner of the veterinary clinic
is Moon Dong-jo.

22:46.865 --> 22:49.659
He has three priors
for manufacturing and distribution.

22:49.743 --> 22:53.205
He's been practicing underground
since he lost his license in 2022.

22:54.373 --> 22:55.957
Here are the photos of the site.

22:59.669 --> 23:01.755
I'll explain the operation.

23:01.838 --> 23:03.382
Team 1, the clinic back door.

23:03.465 --> 23:06.259
Team 2, the restaurant.
Team 3, hair salon.

23:06.343 --> 23:08.053
Once the suspects are inside,

23:08.136 --> 23:10.347
all units will move in
once Command gives the go-ahead.

23:10.430 --> 23:14.142
Once we move in,
the suspects could bolt for the back door,

23:14.226 --> 23:16.228
so Team 1, remain on high alert.

23:18.397 --> 23:23.527
The most important thing is that
we trust only the people in this room.

23:23.610 --> 23:26.822
If any unannounced units show up,
keep your guard up.

23:29.616 --> 23:31.576
They could be cops on the payroll.

23:32.494 --> 23:34.037
Let's work together

23:34.121 --> 23:36.915
and show what good cops are made of.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.250
Yes, sir!

24:04.734 --> 24:08.155
Fuck, seriously?

24:13.743 --> 24:15.662
MOON DONG-JO VETERINARY CLINIC

24:17.622 --> 24:18.832
Team 1, status?

